              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सत्कार करणे — satkār karṇe — \"to felicitate; to honour publicly\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "गावाने विजेत्या खेळाडूचा सत्कार केला. gāvāne vijetyā kheḷāḍūcā satkār kelā. The village honoured the winning player."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with -ने (he …): त्याने सत्कार केला, tyāne satkār kelā."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The person honoured takes -चा: शिक्षकांचा सत्कार करणे (satkār karṇe); सत्कार is masculine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सत्कार करणे (satkār karṇe) joins satkār, a tatsama taken from Sanskrit satkāra, 'kind treatment, honour' (Monier-Williams), to karṇe, 'to do'."
